### 1.3 `BuildDeadlockSnapshot`：纯快照 + 显式清扫

新建 `src/amr_dispatcher_core/include/amr_dispatcher_core/dispatcher/deadlock_snapshot_assembly.hpp`：

```cpp
namespace amr_dispatcher_core::dispatcher {

struct DeadlockSnapshotSources {
  const MissionQueue* queue = nullptr;                                          // 仅用于 Contains()
  const std::unordered_map<std::string, Mission>* active_missions = nullptr;
  const std::unordered_map<std::string, std::chrono::steady_clock::time_point>* last_progress = nullptr;
  const std::unordered_map<std::string, std::vector<std::string>>* pending_wait = nullptr;
  const std::unordered_map<std::string, std::chrono::steady_clock::time_point>* reservation_acquired_at = nullptr;
  const std::unordered_map<std::string, std::string>* held_locks = nullptr;     // resource -> owner
};

struct DeadlockSnapshotAssembly {
  DeadlockSnapshot snapshot;
  std::vector<std::string> stale_wait_mission_ids;  // 不在队列中的幽灵等待者：调用方负责 erase
};

DeadlockSnapshotAssembly AssembleDeadlockSnapshot(const DeadlockSnapshotSources& sources);

}  // namespace
```

- **第一步（纯）**：组包 + 计算"哪些 `pending_wait_` 键已不在队列里"，**不修改任何输入**。
- **第二步（显式）**：ROS 侧 `for (id : stale_wait_mission_ids) pending_wait_.erase(id);` —— 就地清洗从只读函数里消失。

同时统一锁约定：`BuildDeadlockSnapshot` 改名为 `DeadlockSnapshotSources BuildDeadlockSnapshotSources()`（**无锁，只做指针/拷贝绑定**），并在 `DeadlockTick()` 与 `DetectTrafficDeadlockCb` 两处都 `std::lock_guard<std::mutex> lock(active_missions_mutex_);` 包住「取 sources → Assemble → 清扫」整段。单线程 spin 下无语义变化，只是把隐式约定变成显式；e2e 不受影响。

### 1.4 `EnforceVda5050LinkGuard`：聚合策略纯函数

新建 `src/amr_dispatcher_core/include/amr_dispatcher_core/workflow/fleet_link_guard.hpp`（复用 `fleet/vda5050_link_state.hpp`、`workflow/dynamic_unlocking.hpp`）：

```cpp
namespace amr_dispatcher_core::fleet {
struct Vda5050LinkState {           // struct file: fleet/vda5050_link_state.hpp
  bool online = true;               // 乐观初值（与网关 transient_local 重放收敛）
  bool seen_state = false;
  std::chrono::steady_clock::time_point last_state_time{};
  bool position_valid = false;
  double position_x = 0.0;
  double position_y = 0.0;
  double battery_percent = 100.0;
};

bool IsLinkStateStale(const Vda5050LinkState& link,
                      std::chrono::steady_clock::time_point now,
                      std::chrono::milliseconds threshold);
}

namespace amr_dispatcher_core::workflow {

struct VehicleLinkStatus {
  std::string vehicle_id;
  fleet::Vda5050LinkState link;
  bool quarantined = false;
  bool state_stale = false;         // 由 IsLinkStateStale 预计算
};

struct FleetLinkGuardRequest {
  std::vector<VehicleLinkStatus> vehicles;   // 保序（= vda5050_vehicle_ids_）
};

struct LinkGuardVerdict {
  enum class Kind { kOk, kOfflineBlocks, kOfflineQuarantinedSkipped, kStaleWarns };
  Kind kind = Kind::kOk;
  std::string vehicle_id;
  std::string message;              // 直接取 EvaluateVehicleLinkGuard(...).message
};

struct FleetLinkGuardDecision {
  bool block_new_dispatch = false;
  std::string blocking_vehicle_id;  // 首台阻断车（日志/审计）
  std::vector<LinkGuardVerdict> verdicts;
};

FleetLinkGuardDecision EvaluateFleetLinkGuard(const FleetLinkGuardRequest& request);

}  // namespace
```

三条策略显式化并各有单测：隔离车 `continue`（不阻断、不告警）、任一在线车离线即 `block_new_dispatch=true`、`online && seen_state && stale` 只产 `kStaleWarns` 且不影响返回值。ROS 侧 `EnforceVda5050LinkGuard()` 退化为「组 request → 决策 → 按 verdict 打两条原有 throttle 日志 → 返回 `block_new_dispatch`」，日志文案与 throttle 窗口（5000/10000）逐字不变（见 §3 红线 5）。

